text Route111_Text_TrainerHillSign {
    format("{RIGHT_ARROW} TRAINER HILL ENTRANCE\p “Scale the heights, you hot-blooded TRAINERS!”")
}

text Route111_Text_TrainerTipsSpAtkSpDef {
    format("TRAINER TIPS\p One of the indicators of a POKéMON's powerfulness is SP. ATK. It stands for\l “SPECIAL ATTACK.”\p Likewise, SP. DEF stands for “SPECIAL DEFENSE.”")
}

text Route111_Text_RouteSign112 {
    format("ROUTE 111 {LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 112")
}

text Route111_Text_WinstrateHouseSign {
    format("“Our family's hearts beat as one!” THE WINSTRATE'S HOUSE")
}

text Route111_Text_OldLadysRestStopSign {
    format("OLD LADY'S REST STOP “Come in and rest your tired bones.”")
}

text Route111_Text_RouteSignMauville {
    format("ROUTE 111 {DOWN_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY")
}

text Route111_Text_RouteSign113 {
    format("ROUTE 111 {LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 113")
}


text Route111_Text_BeauDefeat {
    "I can't win on spirit alone…"
}

text Route111_Text_BeauIntro {
    "Wearing these GO-GOGGLES makes me\nfeel like a superhero.\nRight now, nobody can beat me!"
}

text Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle {
    "I'm going to be a real hero one day.\nI'm going to work harder to make me\nand my POKéMON stronger."
}

text Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat {
    "I came up short…"
}

text Route111_Text_BeckyIntro {
    "I heard there are fossils to be found\nin the desert. Where could they be?"
}

text Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle {
    "If they can find fossils in the desert,\nit must have been a sea before."
}

text Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat {
    "Ooh lala!\nThat's a lot to take!"
}

text Route111_Text_BiancaIntro {
    "Did you come from MAUVILLE?\nThen you should be full of energy!"
}

text Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle {
    "This road here…\nYou have quite a ways to travel."
}

text Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat {
    "Tch! I thought a sandwich would be\nenough of a bribe…"
}

text Route111_Text_BrandenIntro {
    "I'll give you some of my sandwich\nif you'll lose."
}

text Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle {
    "My SANDSHREW loves eating\nmy sandwiches."
}

text Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat {
    "They didn't just look strong,\nthey are strong!"
}

text Route111_Text_BrookeIntro {
    "Oh, your POKéMON look like serious\nactors.\nI have to ask you for an engagement."
}

text Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle {
    "I thought I was raising my POKéMON\ndiligently, but, oh no, there is still\nmuch to be done."
}

text Route111_Text_BryanDefeat {
    "Oh! Your strength!\nIt is shrouded in mystery!"
}

text Route111_Text_BryanIntro {
    "How tough are you?\nWe shall expose that secret!"
}

text Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle {
    "This desert hoards mysteries in\nits shifting sands!"
}

text Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat {
    "Aww!\nI really shouldn't have come!"
}

text Route111_Text_CeliaIntro {
    "I shouldn't have come to a place like\nthis for a picnic!"
}

text Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle {
    "In a sandstorm like this, I can't set\nthe places for a picnic even with my\nGO-GOGGLES on…"
}

text Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat {
    "Oh… My…\nThat was too much excitement."
}

text Route111_Text_CelinaIntro {
    "Show me how to put a little excitement\ninto my life."
}

text Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle {
    "My pulse is still racing.\nYou're one fabulous TRAINER."
}

text Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat {
    "Uncle! I give up!"
}

text Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro {
    "To train myself, I challenge all\nwhom I meet!"
}

text Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle {
    "All I can do is keep training until\nI can defeat strong TRAINERS such\nas yourself."
}

text Route111_Text_DrewDefeat {
    "I couldn't see what was happening at\nmy sides because of the GO-GOGGLES."
}

text Route111_Text_DrewIntro {
    "Oh, hey! Those GO-GOGGLES suit you.\nBut I think they look better on me.\pLet's decide who they look better on\nwith a battle!"
}

text Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle {
    "The GO-GOGGLES make it possible to\nget through sandstorms.\nThat makes me happy!"
}

text Route111_Text_DustyDefeat {
    "While I have searched for ruins,\nI've not searched for strong POKéMON."
}

text Route111_Text_DustyIntro {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\nI am to be challenged?"
}

text Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle {
    "For thirty years I have searched for\nancient ruins!\pNo, wait, was that forty years?\nWhich was it now?"
}

text Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat {
    "Groan…"
}

text Route111_Text_HaydenIntro {
    "When you're as famished as I am,\nthere is no room for pity!"
}

text Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle {
    "My stomach is grumbling!\nMaybe I can grill some BERRIES…"
}

text Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat {
    "Ohhh! You're mean!"
}

text Route111_Text_HeidiIntro {
    "I'm having a picnic in the desert.\pYou can always find a TRAINER,\nso I can enjoy a battle here, too!"
}

text Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle {
    "When you're battling in a sandstorm,\nwatch out for your POKéMON's HP.\pIt can faint if you don't keep\nan eye on it!"
}

text Route111_Text_IreneDefeat {
    "Oh, you're disgustingly good!"
}

text Route111_Text_IreneIntro {
    "I don't know where you're going,\nbut would you like to battle?"
}

text Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle {
    "I'm thinking that I should go to\nMT. CHIMNEY, but the view around\nhere is very nice, too."
}

text Route111_Text_TravisDefeat {
    "My POKéMON lost its pep…"
}

text Route111_Text_TravisIntro {
    "I'm full of pep!\nAnd my POKéMON is peppy, too!"
}

text Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle {
    "When I see a TRAINER with a lot of pep,\nI can't help looking."
}

text Route111_Text_TyronDefeat {
    "Wait!\nDid you get a good look at my POKéMON?"
}

text Route111_Text_TyronIntro {
    "This is my favorite kind of POKéMON!"
}

text Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle {
    "When having a battle, I get a kick out\nof showing off my POKéMON.\pI bet everyone feels that way when\nthey enter a battle!"
}

text Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat {
    "I see, you've toughened them\nconsiderably."
}

text Route111_Text_WiltonIntro {
    "Show me how much you've toughened\nyour POKéMON."
}

text Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle {
    "POKéMON and TRAINERS learn much\nthrough battling.\pWhat's important is to never give up\neven if you lose."
}